# Backend (`apps/backend`)

Hono API on Node (`@hono/node-server`). Auth: **Better Auth**.

Follow the package and ownership boundaries in `AGENTS.md`. Schema lives in
`@gloaming/db` (Drizzle); use `repository-structure` for structural changes.

## Directory layout

```text
apps/backend/
├── src/
│   ├── index.ts           # HTTP adapter (serve)
│   ├── worker.ts          # BullMQ worker
│   ├── app.ts             # Hono app + global middleware + BA mount
│   ├── constants/
│   ├── db/                # Drizzle client only (no schema)
│   ├── jobs/              # one processor file per job name
│   ├── lib/               # env, redis, queue, logger, auth, errors (no domain workflows)
│   ├── middleware/        # HTTP cross-cutting only
│   ├── modules/           # domain modules: route.ts + service.ts + validator.ts
│   └── routes/            # composition / mount only
├── .env.example
└── package.json
```

## Core rules

| Rule               | Detail                                                                                                                                           |
| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| No RoR controllers | Handlers on `app.get/post` or module `route.ts`; prefer path inference                                                                           |
| Route thin         | Validate → call service → status/JSON. No DB orchestration in routes                                                                             |
| Service thick      | Business rules; no `c.json` / raw Context                                                                                                        |
| `lib/`             | Technical only (redis, queue, env, logger). No `modules/` imports                                                                                |
| Schema             | **Only** in `packages/db` — import `@gloaming/db` / `@gloaming/db/schema`                                                                        |
| Auth               | Better Auth at `/api/auth/*` via `auth.handler`; do not reimplement login/register                                                               |
| Admin auth         | Any `/api/admin/**` route must use `requireAdmin`; hiding navigation or relying on web proxy is not authorization                                |
| Validation         | Zod (`@hono/zod-validator` or shared schemas)                                                                                                    |
| Errors             | Self-owned Hono APIs return `{ error, details? }`; use `sendError` / `sendValidationError` from `src/lib/response.ts` in middleware and handlers |

Better Auth native `/api/auth/*` responses are allowed to keep Better Auth's contract; do not wrap or normalize those endpoints locally.

## Module files

```text
modules/{domain}/
  route.ts
  service.ts
  validator.ts
```

Mount new modules from `routes/index.ts` only — do not grow business logic in `app.ts`.

## Env

`getEnvConfig()` in `src/lib/env.ts` loads package `.env` and Zod-`parse`s it (fail fast at import/boot). Call sites read the exported `env` object — no `process.env` scattered in modules, no one-off getters per variable. Keep only vars the runtime actually reads.
